# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) to override a value, e.g. with a test GA property or a test
# form. Read at build time – rebuild after a change. The values of every production build are in
# .env.production (committed): both keys below are public by design.

# Web3Forms access key of the contact form (docs/decyzje.md D-85, D-98). Empty – sending ends at
# once with the phone and the e-mail.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (docs/decyzje.md D-94, D-95). Loaded only in a production build,
# after consent.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
